 "description": "List/filter channels by a Stream query filter. e.g. filter {\"type\":\"messaging\"} or {\"members\":{\"$in\":[\"user-1\"]}}. Returns channels with recent state. POST /api/v2/chat/channels.",
 "inputSchema": {
